 <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">4.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;To ratify the appointment by the Audit Committee of Ernst&#160;&amp; Young LLP as our independent registered public accounting firm for the year ending December&#160;31, 2023. </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
